# React App Patterns

## Framework

- React Router v7 with file-based routing
- Route types auto-generated in `./+types/` directories
- Use `ActionFunctionArgs`, `LoaderFunctionArgs` from `react-router`

## Components

- Functional components only
- Styling: Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`

## Types and Imports

- Shared types from `app/types.ts`: `Env`, `ResumeData`, `ChunkMetadata`, `Project`
- Zod schemas from `app/schemas`: validation and inferred types
- Path alias `@/` maps to `app/`:
  ```typescript
  import { requestAI } from '@/chat/request';
  ```
